      "id": "facsimile-images",
      "html": "<h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000627_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic000627_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000627.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic000627-thumb.jpg\"></a>"
    },
    {
      "id": "apparatus",
      "html": "<h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text controlled against photographs and drawing of Salinas</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 3\">line.3: <span>The final I is not clearly visible in either published photograph, but is recorded in the drawing of Salinas; autopsy is required</span>  </span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation",
      "html": "<h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>To Titus Fulvius (Fulvus) Aurelius Antoninus, son of Imperator Caesar Marcus Aurelius Antoninus Augustus. Lucius Aponius Rufinus (set this up) to mark the honour of his holding of the sevirate, at his own expense.</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "commentary",
      "html": "<h2>commentary</h2>  <p><a href=\"https://pir.bbaw.de/id/2541\" target=\"_blank\">Titus Aurelius Fulvus Antoninus </a> was the short-lived twin brother of the emperor Commodus, son of the emperor M. Aurelius, born at Lanuvium on 31 August 161, and died in 165. His name often appears in the form Fulvius, as here. </p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "bibliography",
      "html": "<h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> 1906.0075.i <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283</a>  </li><li> 8911 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000352\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000352</a>  </li><li> Salinas NSA 1905 216-218 dr <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 75 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li><li> Wilson 1990 296 fig.253 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509</a>  </li><li> 2006 1266 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283</a>  </li><li> Oliveri 2009 390-391 no.3A ph <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001723\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001723</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  "
    },
